msgctxt "L_AZT_005"
msgid "Retrieve Presidential medical scanner\\n"
msgstr "Recuperar escáner médico del Presidente\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_006"
msgid "Activate distress beacon\\n"
msgstr "Activar la señal de socorro\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_007"
msgid "Shut down enemy jamming device\\n"
msgstr "Apagar la señal de bloqueo enemiga\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_008"
msgid "Retire Presidential clone\\n"
msgstr "Eliminar al clon del Presidente\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_009"
msgid "Locate and rescue President\\n"
msgstr "Localizar y rescatar al Presidente\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_010"
msgid "There's the escape pod.\\n"
msgstr "Ahí está la cápsula de escape.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_011"
msgid "Maybe there's a beacon in there.\\n"
msgstr "Quizá haya un emisor dentro.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_012"
msgid "The jamming... It's coming from that ship.\\n"
msgstr "El bloqueo... Proviene de esa nave.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_013"
msgid "Elvis... He'll be able to protect the President.\\n"
msgstr "Elvis... Él será capaz de proteger al Presidente.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_014"
msgid "Distress beacon has been activated.\\n"
msgstr "Señal de socorro activada.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_015"
msgid "Critical mission object has been destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "Objeto crítico de la misión destruido.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_016"
msgid "Obtain Presidential Scanner.\\n"
msgstr "Obtén el Escáner del Presidente.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_017"
msgid "\\n"
msgstr "\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_018"
msgid "\\n"
msgstr "\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_019"
msgid "A Presidential Scanner\\n"
msgstr "Un Escáner Presidencial\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_020"
msgid "Picked up a Presidential Scanner.\\n"
msgstr "Escáner Presidencial obtenido.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_021"
msgid "Jamming device has been shut down.\\n"
msgstr "Dispositivo de bloqueo apagado.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_022"
msgid "President has been killed.\\n"
msgstr "El Presidente ha muerto.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_023"
msgid "Presidential clone has been eliminated.\\n"
msgstr "El clon del Presidente ha sido eliminado.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_024"
msgid "You'll never save him now!\\n"
msgstr "¡Ahora ya no podrás salvarle!\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_025"
msgid "President has been rescued.\\n"
msgstr "El Presidente ha sido rescatado.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_026"
msgid "Obtain Night Vision.\\n"
msgstr "Obtén Visión Nocturna.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_027"
msgid "Cassandra De Vries'\\n"
msgstr "Cassandra De Vries:\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_028"
msgid "Night Vision\\n"
msgstr "V. Nocturna\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_029"
msgid "Night Vision\\n"
msgstr "Visión Nocturna\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_030"
msgid "Picked up Night Vision.\\n"
msgstr "Visón Nocturna obtenida.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_031"
msgid "Take this; you should find it useful!\\n"
msgstr "Toma esto, ¡lo encontrarás muy útil!\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_032"
msgid "Ahhh... uuhhhh...\\n"
msgstr "Ahhh... uuhhhh...\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_033"
msgid "Ahhh... uhh... owww...\\n"
msgstr "Ahhh... uhh... owww...\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_034"
msgid "Agent Dark! Please report!\\n"
msgstr "¡Agente Dark! ¡Informe, por favor!\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_035"
msgid "Perfect Dark, come in!\\n"
msgstr "¡Perfect Dark, responda!\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_036"
msgid "A-agent Dark reporting in...\\n"
msgstr "A-agente Dark informando...\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_037"
msgid "Agent Dark! Please reply!\\n"
msgstr "¡Agente Dark! ¡Por favor, responda!\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_038"
msgid ""
"Something's jamming my transmissions... It's coming from that other "
"craft.\\n"
msgstr "Algo está bloqueando mis transmisiones... Proviene de esa otra nave.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_039"
msgid ""
"I'd better find the jamming device and check that Elvis is okay. Not "
"forgetting the President, of course.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Mejor encontrar el dispositivo de bloqueo y comprobar si Elvis está bien. No"
" olvidando al Presidente, por supuesto.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_040"
msgid "How are you feeling, Mr. President?\\n"
msgstr "¿Cómo se siente, Sr. Presidente?\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_041"
msgid ""
"Better now, young lady. Today, I think, will take a while for me to get "
"over. I can't believe Easton would do such a thing. I knew he was ambitious,"
" yes, but this...\\n"
msgstr ""
"Ahora mejor, jovencita. Pero creo que me va a llevar un rato recuperarme. No"
" puedo creer que Easton hiciera algo así. Sabía que era ambicioso, sí, pero "
"esto...\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_042"
msgid ""
"Just one thing, sir? What is the Pelagic II that Trent wanted so badly?\\n"
msgstr "Sólo una cosa, señor. ¿Qué es el Pelagic II que tanto ansiaba Trent?\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_043"
msgid ""
"It's a U.S. government deep sea research vessel, one of a kind... The only "
"ship that can conduct a full-scale diving operation at extreme depth. Trent "
"wanted me to loan it to the dataDyne Corporation, but I refused.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Es un navío de investigación de profundidad del gobierno norteamericano, "
"único en su clase... El único barco capaz de dirigir una operación a gran "
"escala a profundidad extrema. Trent quería que se lo prestara a la "
"Corporación dataDyne, pero rehusé.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_044"
msgid "Trent has a lot to answer for, but I don't think we'll find him now.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Trent tiene bastante que contestar, pero no creo que le encontremos "
"ahora.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_045"
msgid ""
"You have failed, Easton. You are a flawed device, and we need you no "
"longer.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Has fallado, Easton. Eres un dispositivo defectuoso, y ya no te "
"necesitamos.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_046"
msgid "Just try it, you Scandinavian freak!\\n"
msgstr "¡Inténtalo, mamarracho escandinavo!\\n"

msgctxt "L_AZT_047"
msgid "Noooooooo!!!\\n"
msgstr "¡¡¡Noooooooo!!!\\n"
